1
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:09,320
(The Underworld)

2
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:12,080
(Shen Yanlin)

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:18,320
♪Cruel world, where trust runs thin♪
(Ling Che)

4
00:00:19,600 --> 00:00:22,320
♪Blades clash. Who will rise above?♪
(Shuangdao Hui)

5
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:28,040
♪Behind every smile, danger waits♪
(Dongshan Tai)

6
00:00:28,040 --> 00:00:30,520
(Fei Liu)

7
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:35,080
♪Know your limits, know your worth♪
(Luo Song)

8
00:00:36,080 --> 00:00:39,800
♪Stand strong against the raging tide♪
(Annie)

9
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:44,120
♪Ask how many times I've lost my way♪

10
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Storms rage on the road to power♪

11
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:52,960
♪Let old promises fade into memory♪

12
00:00:52,960 --> 00:00:58,040
♪Alone and fearless, I won't back down♪

13
00:00:58,040 --> 00:01:02,120
♪Power is a crown forged in blood♪

14
00:01:02,120 --> 00:01:09,040
♪Brotherhood is shelter from the storm♪

15
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:15,680
=The Underworld=

16
00:01:15,680 --> 00:01:19,120
(1994)

17
00:01:28,680 --> 00:01:29,640
(Fu, Shen Yanlin's brother)

18
00:01:31,519 --> 00:01:31,799
Bro!

19
00:01:31,799 --> 00:01:32,719
Sir! Sir!

20
00:01:32,719 --> 00:01:33,519
Sorry! Sorry!

21
00:01:33,879 --> 00:01:34,799
I'm so sorry.

22
00:01:35,799 --> 00:01:36,599
(Business for Sale)
Move! Move!

23
00:01:37,640 --> 00:01:40,000
Think you can afford to ruin my suit?

24
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:41,400
Sorry. I'm really sorry.

25
00:01:45,640 --> 00:01:46,079
Stop!

26
00:01:46,079 --> 00:01:46,719
Bro, run!

27
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:49,840
Not so fast. Where are you going?

28
00:01:50,079 --> 00:01:50,719
Sir! Sir!

29
00:01:51,040 --> 00:01:51,599
It's a misunderstanding.

30
00:01:51,879 --> 00:01:53,359
Trying to set me up?

31
00:01:54,799 --> 00:01:55,879
Y-Your wallet, sir.

32
00:01:59,799 --> 00:02:00,680
We didn't touch it.

33
00:02:01,319 --> 00:02:04,439
Have some candy.

34
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:06,200
Sir.

35
00:02:06,200 --> 00:02:07,359
Have some candy.

36
00:02:07,799 --> 00:02:08,319
Candy.

37
00:02:08,599 --> 00:02:09,319
Have some?

38
00:02:09,960 --> 00:02:10,560
Sweet, no?

39
00:02:11,120 --> 00:02:12,719
I'm sorry, sir. I'm sorry.

40
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:14,319
My brother's not all there.

41
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:15,919
Not all there?

42
00:02:16,479 --> 00:02:18,240
Then beat some sense into him.

43
00:02:19,039 --> 00:02:19,439
Get him!

44
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:25,719
Lin!

45
00:02:35,639 --> 00:02:36,800
Lin!

46
00:02:38,319 --> 00:02:39,479
Lin!

47
00:02:42,080 --> 00:02:42,879
Lin!

48
00:02:43,199 --> 00:02:43,879
Come on!

49
00:02:44,240 --> 00:02:44,919
Come on!

50
00:02:46,680 --> 00:02:48,400
♪Stray dog, stray dog♪

51
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:48,840
Eat it.

52
00:02:49,639 --> 00:02:52,080
Eat it. Every last bit.

53
00:02:52,479 --> 00:02:53,280
Hurry up!

54
00:02:54,599 --> 00:02:55,120
Tasty.

55
00:02:57,759 --> 00:02:58,719
Tasty.

56
00:03:07,159 --> 00:03:08,000
Taste good?

57
00:03:12,600 --> 00:03:15,280
(Shicheng Transport)

58
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:03,520
Boss Che.

59
00:04:04,919 --> 00:04:05,400
Boss Che.

60
00:04:05,840 --> 00:04:07,199
By Dongcheng Gang rules,

61
00:04:07,479 --> 00:04:08,400
if you steal from the boss,

62
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:09,439
you get dumped in the sea.

63
00:04:10,719 --> 00:04:11,639
Sounds about right.

64
00:04:12,719 --> 00:04:13,240
Boss Che.

65
00:04:13,759 --> 00:04:14,599
I'll never do it again.

66
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:16,519
I'll give you everything I earn.

67
00:04:18,199 --> 00:04:18,800
Really?

68
00:04:19,399 --> 00:04:19,839
Really.

69
00:04:20,480 --> 00:04:21,519
No amount of money

70
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:23,519
can buy your way around our rules.

71
00:04:23,800 --> 00:04:24,560
Teach him a lesson.

72
00:04:24,879 --> 00:04:25,480
Break his leg.

73
00:04:25,639 --> 00:04:26,399
Boss Che, please!

74
00:04:36,439 --> 00:04:37,120
Don't be scared.

75
00:04:41,839 --> 00:04:43,199
Don't let me see you in Shicheng again.

76
00:04:45,639 --> 00:04:46,120
Go.

77
00:04:47,519 --> 00:04:48,199
Come on.

78
00:04:48,399 --> 00:04:49,199
Come here.

79
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:52,600
Boss Che! Boss Che!

80
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:55,639
Let me. I'll do it.

81
00:04:59,959 --> 00:05:00,519
What?

82
00:05:01,279 --> 00:05:01,759
Boss Che.

83
00:05:02,759 --> 00:05:03,360
I want to work for you.

84
00:05:10,079 --> 00:05:11,160
Dongcheng Gang

85
00:05:11,959 --> 00:05:12,639
doesn't take in beggars.

86
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:30,120
Bye-bye!

87
00:05:41,279 --> 00:05:41,879
What are you drawing?

88
00:05:45,519 --> 00:05:47,759
A big house.

89
00:05:51,279 --> 00:05:51,800
Fu.

90
00:05:52,439 --> 00:05:53,399
When I have money,

91
00:05:55,199 --> 00:05:56,160
we'll

92
00:05:57,040 --> 00:05:58,240
live in a big house.

93
00:05:58,800 --> 00:05:59,839
We'll live like kings.

94
00:06:00,800 --> 00:06:01,800
Okay.

95
00:06:03,560 --> 00:06:06,440
=Episode 2=

96
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:10,040
(1999)

97
00:06:14,600 --> 00:06:15,600
I'm Boss Hai's man.

98
00:06:15,600 --> 00:06:16,519
You dare lay a hand on me?

99
00:06:22,240 --> 00:06:23,160
What the...?

100
00:06:26,000 --> 00:06:27,800
That's exactly why

101
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:29,759
you shouldn't be running.

102
00:06:29,759 --> 00:06:31,839
Where's your loyalty?

103
00:06:43,240 --> 00:06:43,680
Boss Hui.

104
00:06:44,399 --> 00:06:46,199
Boss Hai went to the teahouse alone.

105
00:06:46,399 --> 00:06:47,720
He wouldn't let anyone follow him.

106
00:06:48,199 --> 00:06:49,279
I've told you everything I know.

107
00:06:50,079 --> 00:06:50,639
Please let me go.

108
00:06:52,600 --> 00:06:55,279
Who are you? What do you want?

109
00:06:57,720 --> 00:06:58,240
What do you want?

110
00:07:00,600 --> 00:07:01,759
Looking for trouble?

111
00:07:05,600 --> 00:07:06,360
Quiet.

112
00:07:06,639 --> 00:07:07,399
Quiet!

113
00:07:08,680 --> 00:07:09,360
Let him through.

114
00:07:13,399 --> 00:07:13,879
Hui.

115
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:16,160
What are you doing?

116
00:07:17,399 --> 00:07:18,399
Just asking a few questions.

117
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:20,560
Why the rush?

118
00:07:21,519 --> 00:07:22,079
Questions?

119
00:07:23,319 --> 00:07:25,240
Looks more like you want him dead.

120
00:07:27,199 --> 00:07:29,319
You're handing him over to me today.

121
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:34,959
Mao planned to flee
on Baitou Lao's boat.

122
00:07:36,160 --> 00:07:38,399
Baitou Lao works for Nanhu Gang.

123
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:42,519
You met with him last week.

124
00:07:42,519 --> 00:07:43,959
Coincidence?

125
00:07:47,720 --> 00:07:48,480
You investigated me?

126
00:07:49,439 --> 00:07:50,639
I didn't.

127
00:07:52,680 --> 00:07:53,560
I think

128
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:56,199
someone's trying to destroy evidence.

129
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:02,040
You.

130
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:04,879
Answer whatever Hui asks you.

131
00:08:04,879 --> 00:08:05,600
Don't get anything wrong.

132
00:08:06,199 --> 00:08:07,199
One wrong answer,

133
00:08:07,319 --> 00:08:08,360
and I'll kill your whole family.

134
00:08:14,879 --> 00:08:15,720
Let's go.

135
00:08:28,320 --> 00:08:33,120
(Humane Community. Virtuous neighbors.)

136
00:08:36,679 --> 00:08:37,200
Boss Tai.

137
00:08:38,360 --> 00:08:40,159
The elders aren't happy with Boss Hui.

138
00:08:40,879 --> 00:08:41,600
Let him be.

139
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:43,399
We just let him run wild?

140
00:08:43,759 --> 00:08:44,480
Boss Hui

141
00:08:44,879 --> 00:08:46,960
is desperate to avenge Boss Hai.

142
00:08:47,399 --> 00:08:48,919
That's just how he operates.

143
00:08:50,320 --> 00:08:51,039
Besides,

144
00:08:51,639 --> 00:08:54,399
aren't we investigating too?

145
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:56,440
You really think outsiders

146
00:08:56,879 --> 00:08:57,840
have nothing against us?

147
00:08:58,480 --> 00:08:59,679
That they're not talking
behind our backs?

148
00:09:06,080 --> 00:09:07,720
I've run this place for over ten years.

149
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:08,799
Usually,

150
00:09:09,320 --> 00:09:11,559
I tend my plants and keep birds.

151
00:09:12,120 --> 00:09:13,879
I've never been to anything like this.

152
00:09:17,519 --> 00:09:18,159
Mr. Chen.

153
00:09:18,639 --> 00:09:20,200
Just a small token.

154
00:09:22,039 --> 00:09:23,320
You gentlemen

155
00:09:23,720 --> 00:09:24,679
have always looked out for me.

156
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:26,200
I know it isn't just

157
00:09:26,679 --> 00:09:27,519
because my tea is good.

158
00:09:27,919 --> 00:09:28,480
Mr. Chen.

159
00:09:29,399 --> 00:09:30,240
I know the rules.

160
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:32,440
You're running a business.

161
00:09:32,679 --> 00:09:33,480
All you want is peace.

162
00:09:35,039 --> 00:09:36,080
But Boss Hai is dead,

163
00:09:36,879 --> 00:09:38,879
and the gang thinks Boss Hui did it.

164
00:09:39,879 --> 00:09:40,759
Boss Hui once helped me.

165
00:09:41,559 --> 00:09:43,679
I have to find out what happened.

166
00:10:01,039 --> 00:10:03,159
Boss Hai came here five days ago.

167
00:10:03,720 --> 00:10:04,919
Mr. Chen, do you remember

168
00:10:04,919 --> 00:10:06,519
who was here that day?

169
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:07,799
Well...

170
00:10:09,440 --> 00:10:10,279
You two, step outside.

171
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:27,480
I'm getting old.

172
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:28,600
I can't even remember

173
00:10:29,120 --> 00:10:29,799
what I ate yesterday.

174
00:10:30,720 --> 00:10:32,679
How could I remember five days ago?

175
00:10:33,720 --> 00:10:35,200
Then make sure you eat well tonight.

176
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:40,480
Hello?

177
00:10:42,799 --> 00:10:44,320
Mr. Chen, something came up. Gotta go.

178
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:45,679
Let's go.

179
00:10:46,879 --> 00:10:47,240
Where?

180
00:10:52,320 --> 00:10:53,159
Where are my girls?

181
00:10:57,519 --> 00:10:58,039
Boss Che.

182
00:10:58,879 --> 00:10:59,919
What did Mr. Chen write?

183
00:11:00,919 --> 00:11:02,240
I told you to learn to read.

184
00:11:03,759 --> 00:11:04,879
Hutou Jun met with Boss Hai.

185
00:11:12,600 --> 00:11:13,440
Boss Che. Boss Che.

186
00:11:13,799 --> 00:11:14,440
What happened?

187
00:11:14,600 --> 00:11:15,600
Boss Lin. Boss Lin.

188
00:11:44,080 --> 00:11:45,759
B-Boss Lin...

189
00:11:45,759 --> 00:11:46,399
Get out.

190
00:11:47,360 --> 00:11:47,960
You, talk.

191
00:11:49,039 --> 00:11:50,039
They had guns.

192
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:55,799
Know who did it?

193
00:11:56,080 --> 00:11:57,080
N-No...

194
00:11:57,080 --> 00:11:57,519
Shut up.

195
00:12:04,120 --> 00:12:05,960
They could elect a shot-caller anytime.

196
00:12:06,360 --> 00:12:07,720
Boss Hui needs money now more than ever.

197
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:09,279
The jewels are gone.

198
00:12:10,039 --> 00:12:11,320
How am I supposed to get the cash?

199
00:12:12,720 --> 00:12:13,200
You gonna conjure it up?

200
00:12:14,399 --> 00:12:15,039
You?

201
00:12:15,440 --> 00:12:16,200
Or you?

202
00:12:16,879 --> 00:12:17,559
Lin.

203
00:12:19,240 --> 00:12:21,120
This is bigger than you think.

204
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:24,360
Get out! Go!

205
00:12:24,879 --> 00:12:25,240
Out!

206
00:12:26,240 --> 00:12:26,600
Go!

207
00:12:26,600 --> 00:12:27,279
Let's go.

208
00:12:35,720 --> 00:12:36,639
You think

209
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:38,879
someone's trying to
stop our investigation

210
00:12:39,159 --> 00:12:40,200
by stealing our shipment?

211
00:12:40,600 --> 00:12:42,159
The two things may be connected.

212
00:12:43,279 --> 00:12:44,440
Find whoever stole the shipment,

213
00:12:46,840 --> 00:12:47,759
and we'll know the truth.

214
00:12:48,120 --> 00:12:50,639
And where are we supposed to find them?

215
00:12:52,080 --> 00:12:52,759
Relax.

216
00:12:53,360 --> 00:12:55,320
Every job leaves a trail.

217
00:13:13,480 --> 00:13:17,200
We checked every black market
and jewelry store.

218
00:13:17,720 --> 00:13:18,960
(Dongcheng White Horse)
No one's tried to sell the jewels.

219
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:21,440
Maybe they're lying low.

220
00:13:22,440 --> 00:13:24,080
(Dongcheng White Horse)
Maybe they never planned to sell them.

221
00:13:24,679 --> 00:13:25,519
Find anything?

222
00:13:26,320 --> 00:13:27,639
The rifling marks on these bullets

223
00:13:27,639 --> 00:13:29,000
aren't what we usually see.

224
00:13:29,960 --> 00:13:32,000
They look homemade in Central Asia.

225
00:13:32,480 --> 00:13:33,559
They're cheap

226
00:13:33,559 --> 00:13:35,000
and harder for police to trace.

227
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:36,679
That's why a lot of gangs

228
00:13:37,159 --> 00:13:38,519
use this kind of ammunition.

229
00:13:41,639 --> 00:13:42,519
The thieves

230
00:13:42,519 --> 00:13:44,080
probably used a 1911 pistol.

231
00:13:44,480 --> 00:13:45,039
These guns

232
00:13:45,399 --> 00:13:46,919
often come from Central Asian workshops

233
00:13:47,039 --> 00:13:47,879
that rebuild old guns.

234
00:13:48,880 --> 00:13:50,240
(Dongcheng White Horse)

235
00:13:50,240 --> 00:13:51,279
You're saying

236
00:13:51,440 --> 00:13:53,039
this lousy shell casing

237
00:13:53,039 --> 00:13:54,840
could lead us to the thieves?

238
00:13:55,679 --> 00:13:56,200
Maybe.

239
00:14:00,120 --> 00:14:00,679
Boss Che.

240
00:14:01,679 --> 00:14:02,919
How do you know all this?

241
00:14:04,759 --> 00:14:07,120
The way you broke all that down,

242
00:14:07,840 --> 00:14:09,240
you sounded just like a cop.

243
00:14:12,200 --> 00:14:13,760
(Dongcheng White Horse)

244
00:14:14,600 --> 00:14:15,080
That's right.

245
00:14:16,399 --> 00:14:17,279
I am a cop.

246
00:14:18,120 --> 00:14:19,320
If you're a cop,

247
00:14:20,639 --> 00:14:23,519
then I'm Dongcheng's top dog.

248
00:14:26,760 --> 00:14:28,960
(Dongcheng White Horse)

249
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:34,039
What's with that look?

250
00:14:35,320 --> 00:14:36,120
Can't read?

251
00:14:37,039 --> 00:14:38,279
(Dongcheng White Horse)
Dongcheng's top dog.

252
00:14:39,080 --> 00:14:39,720
Repeat.

253
00:14:40,639 --> 00:14:44,080
(Dongcheng White Horse)
Dongcheng's top dog.

254
00:14:44,080 --> 00:14:44,840
That's right.

255
00:14:47,560 --> 00:14:49,320
(Dongcheng White Horse)

256
00:14:49,879 --> 00:14:52,559
(If gangs use these rounds a lot,)

257
00:14:53,039 --> 00:14:55,559
(the arms dealer may visit Shicheng.)

258
00:14:56,080 --> 00:14:58,120
(Put out word that we're buying guns.)

259
00:14:58,559 --> 00:14:59,120
(Set the bait,)

260
00:15:00,039 --> 00:15:00,919
(and the fish will bite.)

261
00:15:02,480 --> 00:15:05,200
(Top Prices for Scrap)

262
00:15:05,200 --> 00:15:07,520
(Old Goods 35201)

263
00:15:07,520 --> 00:15:09,280
(Top Prices for Scrap)

264
00:15:11,600 --> 00:15:15,160
♪Live by the blade, die by the blade♪

265
00:15:18,040 --> 00:15:21,440
♪Ride the waves
and you may drown in them♪

266
00:15:23,720 --> 00:15:26,120
♪If you gamble your life, go all in♪

267
00:15:26,880 --> 00:15:30,440
♪Leave it to fate. Take it if you dare♪

268
00:15:37,280 --> 00:15:39,880
♪They say every brother has his price♪

269
00:15:39,880 --> 00:15:43,080
♪They say this world swallows you whole♪

270
00:15:43,720 --> 00:15:46,440
♪I won this life on a roll of the dice♪

271
00:15:46,440 --> 00:15:49,640
♪I staked my soul to set myself free♪

272
00:15:49,720 --> 00:15:54,000
♪I was born too tough to break♪

273
00:15:56,800 --> 00:16:01,320
♪Tough enough to walk this road to ruin♪

274
00:16:03,160 --> 00:16:07,360
♪This is my fate. I won't fight it♪

275
00:16:10,120 --> 00:16:13,680
♪I'd rather call my own shots♪

276
00:16:16,720 --> 00:16:19,240
♪Incense fades,
but the ashes still burn♪

277
00:16:19,240 --> 00:16:22,640
♪Every prayer at the altar rings hollow♪

278
00:16:22,640 --> 00:16:26,040
♪On this long road, never bow your head♪

279
00:16:26,040 --> 00:16:29,360
♪On this road, there's no turning back♪

280
00:16:29,360 --> 00:16:33,000
♪The faces onstage keep changing♪

281
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:36,600
♪While blood below keeps pooling♪

282
00:16:36,600 --> 00:16:39,400
♪Never bow. I call the shots here♪

283
00:16:39,400 --> 00:16:42,080
♪No way back. Only forward♪
